  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is",
