  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the neighbourhood of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, in the neighbourhood of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, which is positive<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sec</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
